# Project specific
!icon.ico
!logo.png
# The desktop app's packaging icon lives under build/, which is ignored above.
# Both the directory and the file must be re-included: git never descends into
# an ignored directory, so a file-only exception would be silently dropped and
# CI would package the default Electron icon.
!ske_desktop/build/
!ske_desktop/build/icon.png

.claude
.claude/

_verify/